{
  "$comment": "The index of this specification: every endpoint observed on the wire, the schema that describes it, and the example files that tools/check-backend-schemas.mjs validates against it. An endpoint whose schema is null is one that was seen but is not a JSON API (the CDN's fragments are raw bytes), or one whose element shape was never observed. Nothing in schemas/backend-api/ may be missing from this list: the checker fails on an orphaned schema or example file.",
  "capturedOn": {
    "build": "Arma Reforger 1.8.0.13",
    "engine": 192142,
    "method": "A dedicated server, and once the game client, run behind a TLS-terminating proxy on one machine; the captures are listed in the source table of docs/en/ArmaReforger_BackendAPI_EN.md section 9 and kept outside the repository (out/, gitignored).",
    "examples": "Generated from those captures with every identifier and secret replaced by a fixed placeholder, and with the career values zeroed; see README.md."
  },
